{"id": 114, "name": "Melissa", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/1/14/Hero1141-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021143430", "cls": ["Marksman", ""], "specialty": ["Finisher", "Damage"], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["20", "90", "40", "40"], "lanes": ["Gold Lane", ""], "story": "A girl with cursed needles who runs a tailor shop and solves problems for clients.", "skills": [{"name": "Doll Buster", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1885d2903ffe007effddfef83f69f28f.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "\"My tailor shop excels at fixing and 'fixing' dolls. Am I right, Muddles?\"\n\n(Melissa deals 125% damage to Minions, Creeps, and Summoned Units.)"}, {"name": "Falling!", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_c00db06b0bccee41a914ec8301feed2b.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 5   Mana Cost: 30", "desc": "\"Watch me slide forward and boost Attack Speed for 3 seconds— Ah, that was just boring…\"\n\n\"<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Muddles</span>, go that way!\"\n\"<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Cuddles</span>, come here!\""}, {"name": "Eyes on You!", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_5f7c343dbca6eb726c39c44f46397e47.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 23, "tagname": "Debuff", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 9   Mana Cost: 90", "desc": "The plan's like this: Throw <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Muddles</span> out to hold down the bad guys, and then… I come on stage!\n\"I puncture the bad guys, while <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Giggles</span> hit <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Muddles</span> to punish them as well! Hee, fantastic!\"\n\n(<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Muddles</span> deals 175<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> on the first hit and links nearby enemies for up to 6s. Linked enemies are slowed by 60% that decays over 1.5s and can break the link by moving out of the range. <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Muddles</span> will return to Melissa early when there are no enemies around and immediately if she's too far away. When <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Muddles</span> is present, you can tap the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Attack Minion</span> button to directly attack <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Muddles</span>, though it cannot trigger the multi-hit damage. <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Giggles</span> only hits <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Muddles</span> when Melissa has a target for her Basic Attack.)"}, {"name": "Go Away!", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b5b3a37f13c02756c783788a2e2d675f.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 71, "tagname": "Summon", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 50   Mana Cost: 120", "desc": "\"<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Cuddles</span>, protect me! For 4 seconds, let no bad guys come close. Unless I say otherwise!\"\n\n(Upon activation, Melissa gains a 300<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+200% Extra Physical Attack)</span> shield and knocks back enemies in the area, dealing 500<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+100% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>. Enemies attempting to enter the field are knocked back, taking 50<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+10% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and slowed briefly. Movement skills are interrupted unless the target has Control Immunity.\nThe field will move with Melissa once, when she's about to move out of the boundary.)"}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Corrosion Scythe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img